---
title: "1 · Create a workspace"
description: Create a department workspace for the department, where its case templates and cases live.
sidebar:
  order: 2
  label: "1 · Create a workspace"
---

**Who:** tenant admin. **Where:** the left sidebar.

## Open the workspace menu

In the left sidebar, select **…** (**Options**) next to the workspace title, and then select **Add new workspace**.

{% screenshot id="case-templates/workspace-menu" caption="The workspace options menu." /%}

## Fill in the workspace

{% steps %}

1. In **Name**, enter the workspace name, for example `Sample After-sales`.
2. In **Type**, choose **Department workspace**.
3. In **Department**, choose the department you created.
4. Select **Create**.

{% /steps %}

{% screenshot id="case-templates/workspace-create" caption="The Create workspace dialog." /%}

## You land in the new workspace

The page changes to the new workspace. It has no boards yet, so it opens on **My Week**. The sidebar shows **My Week** and **Cases**; the next page adds the first case template.

{% screenshot id="case-templates/workspace-empty" caption="A new department workspace, opened on My Week." /%}
